                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The dishes are delicate and delicious. I especially recommend the seafood soup risotto—slightly spicy, richly flavored, and absolutely delightful in every bite. Though the seafood portion isn’t abundant, you can taste the chef’s dedication in every spoonful.\n\nDrinks are unlimited, and I highly recommend the unsweetened toffee black tea, which has a unique and fragrant aroma.\n\nThis seems to be a family-friendly restaurant, as they provide special seats for children. I also noticed quite a few kids dining there.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
